  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Posebne rešitve </h2>",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/6/csm_reamCheck_cd82613a3d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»reamCheck«",
     "href": "/si/izdelki/nastavitev-in-merjenje/vertikalne-naprave/venturion/modeli/reamcheck",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»reamCheck«</h3> <p>With »reamCheck«, you can set complete machining tools such as long reamers and fine boring tools fully automatically, quickly, accurately and independently of the operator.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_torquematic_a1d5f5dc22.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»torquematic«",
     "href": "/si/izdelki/nastavitev-in-merjenje/vertikalne-naprave/venturion/modeli/torquematic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»torquematic«</h3> <p>With »torquematic«, tools with collet tool holders can be set to length, clamped to a predefined torque and measured fully automatically.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/0/csm_tribos_777b335f4d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»tribos«",
     "href": "/si/izdelki/nastavitev-in-merjenje/vertikalne-naprave/venturion/modeli/tribos",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»tribos«</h3> <p>With »tribos«, you can mount and measure the polygonal shrink fit tool holders of the TRIBOS type from SCHUNK with μm-precise length.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/0/csm_redomatic_e7534663d3.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»redomatic«",
     "href": "/si/izdelki/tehnika-krcenja/redomatic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»redomatic«</h3> <p>»redomatic« is the high-end solution for automated measuring, adjusting and shrinking.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/4/csm_smartCheck_704ca1e175.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»smartCheck«",
     "href": "/si/izdelki/preverjanje-in-merjenje/univerzalni-merilni-stroji/smartcheck",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»smartCheck«</h3> <p>The »smartCheck« setting, measuring and inspection device can visualize the surface condition of the cutting edge on the face and circumference.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
